  "Comprehensive Reporting and Analytics": "Umfassende Berichterstattung und Analyse",
  "The Cart Quantity module also offers comprehensive reporting and analytics to help you make informed decisions about your inventory. Detailed reports on stock levels, sales trends, and cart activity provide valuable insights into customer behavior and product performance. With this data, you can optimize your inventory management strategies, improve your supply chain, and enhance overall operational efficiency.": "Das Modul „Warenkorbmenge“ bietet außerdem umfassende Berichte und Analysen, die Ihnen helfen, fundierte Entscheidungen über Ihren Lagerbestand zu treffen. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Experience": "Verbessertes Kundenerlebnis",
  "Providing a seamless shopping experience is essential for customer satisfaction and retention. The Cart Quantity module improves the customer experience by clearly displaying available stock levels and preventing the addition of out-of-stock items to the cart. Customers can shop with confidence, knowing that the items they select are available for purchase. This transparency builds trust and encourages repeat business.": "Die Bereitstellung eines reibungslosen Einkaufserlebnisses ist für die Kundenzufriedenheit und -bindung von entscheidender Bedeutung. ",
  "Real-Time Quantity Updates": "Mengenaktualisierungen in Echtzeit",
  "The Cart Quantity module offers real-time updates to your inventory, ensuring that customers always see the most current stock levels. As soon as an item is added to a cart, the available quantity is adjusted, providing an accurate reflection of what is in stock. This feature reduces the risk of customer frustration due to unavailable products and enhances the overall shopping experience. To utilize these features, it is necessary to enable the cart quantity control button from the store settings.": "Das Modul „Warenkorbmenge“ bietet Echtzeitaktualisierungen Ihres Lagerbestands und stellt sicher, dass Kunden immer die aktuellsten Lagerbestände sehen. ",
  "Dynamic Stock Alerts": "Dynamische Aktienwarnungen",
  "To further streamline inventory management, the Cart Quantity module includes dynamic stock alerts. When stock levels for a particular item reach a predefined threshold, notifications are automatically generated, prompting timely restocking. This proactive approach helps ensure that popular items are always available, preventing lost sales and maximizing revenue opportunities.": "Um die Bestandsverwaltung weiter zu optimieren, enthält das Modul „Warenkorbmenge“ dynamische Bestandswarnungen. ",
